#: ../../authentication.md:1
msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "Uthibitishaji"

#: ../../authentication.md:3
msgid ""
"Every endpoint except `/health` needs an API key. Send it in the "
"`Authorization` header as a bearer token."
msgstr ""
"Kila endpoint isipokuwa `/health` inahitaji API key. Itume kwenye header "
"`Authorization` kama tokeni ya Bearer."

#: ../../authentication.md:9
msgid ""
"The public demo key is `lugha_demo_key`. It is shared and rate limited, "
"so use it for trying things out and nothing else."
msgstr ""
"API key ya majaribio ya umma ni `lugha_demo_key`. Inashirikiwa na ina "
"kikomo cha matumizi, kwa hiyo itumie kwa majaribio pekee na si kwa "
"madhumuni mengine."

#: ../../authentication.md:11
msgid "Keep your key out of your code"
msgstr "Usiweke key yako ndani ya code yako"

#: ../../authentication.md:13
msgid "Read the key from an environment variable."
msgstr "Soma key kutoka kwenye environment variable."

#: ../../authentication.md:21
msgid "Three rules keep keys safe."
msgstr "Sheria tatu husaidia kuweka keys salama."

#: ../../authentication.md:23
msgid ""
"Never commit a key to source control. Add any file that holds a key, such"
" as `.env`, to `.gitignore`."
msgstr ""
"Usiwahi kuweka key kwenye source control. Ongeza faili yoyote iliyo na "
"key, kama `.env`, kwenye `.gitignore`."

#: ../../authentication.md:24
msgid ""
"Never put a key in code that runs in a browser or a mobile app. Anyone "
"can read it. Call the API from your own server instead."
msgstr ""
"Usiwahi kuweka key kwenye code inayotumika kwenye browser au mobile app. "
"Mtu yeyote anaweza kuisoma. Badala yake, ita API kutoka kwenye server "
"yako mwenyewe."

#: ../../authentication.md:25
msgid ""
"Never paste a key into a support message. Send the `request_id` from the "
"error instead."
msgstr ""
"Usiwahi kubandika key kwenye ujumbe wa support. Badala yake, tuma "
"`request_id` kutoka kwenye error."

#: ../../authentication.md:27
msgid "Rotate keys without downtime"
msgstr "Badilisha keys bila kusababisha huduma kusimama"

#: ../../authentication.md:29
msgid "The service accepts more than one key at a time. To rotate:"
msgstr "Huduma inakubali zaidi ya key moja kwa wakati mmoja. Ili kubadilisha key:"

#: ../../authentication.md:31
msgid "Add the new key alongside the old one."
msgstr "Ongeza key mpya pamoja na key ya zamani."

#: ../../authentication.md:32
msgid "Deploy your applications with the new key."
msgstr "Deploy applications zako ukitumia key mpya."

#: ../../authentication.md:33
msgid "Remove the old key once nothing uses it."
msgstr "Ondoa key ya zamani baada ya kuhakikisha hakuna kinachoitumia."

#: ../../authentication.md:35
msgid "If a key leaks, remove it straight away and issue a new one."
msgstr ""
"Ikiwa key imevuja, iondoe mara moja na utoe key mpya."

#: ../../authentication.md:37
msgid "Authentication errors"
msgstr "Makosa ya uthibitishaji"

#: ../../authentication.md:39
msgid "Both authentication failures return status `401`."
msgstr "Makwazo yote mawili ya uthibitishaji yanarudisha status `401`."

#: ../../authentication.md
msgid "`type`"
msgstr "`type`"

#: ../../authentication.md
msgid "Cause"
msgstr "Sababu"

#: ../../authentication.md
msgid "What to do"
msgstr "Cha kufanya"

#: ../../authentication.md
msgid "`authentication_required`"
msgstr "`authentication_required`"

#: ../../authentication.md
msgid "The `Authorization` header is missing, or it does not start with `Bearer`."
msgstr ""
"Header ya `Authorization` haipo, au haianzi na `Bearer`."

#: ../../authentication.md
msgid "Add the header in the format above."
msgstr "Ongeza header kwa muundo ulioonyeshwa hapo juu."

#: ../../authentication.md
msgid "`invalid_api_key`"
msgstr "`invalid_api_key`"

#: ../../authentication.md
msgid "The header is well formed but the key is not recognised."
msgstr "Header imeundwa kwa usahihi lakini key haitambuliki."

#: ../../authentication.md
msgid "Check for typos, extra spaces and expired keys."
msgstr ""
"Angalia makosa ya kuandika, nafasi za ziada na keys zilizokwisha muda."

#: ../../authentication.md:46
msgid "Do not retry a `401`. The same request will fail the same way."
msgstr ""
"Usijaribu tena ombi linalorudisha `401`. Ombi hilo hilo litashindwa kwa "
"njia hiyo hiyo."